### ms-conductores — LogiTrans Express (puerto 8002)

@base = http://localhost:8002
@token = 15718855e7bfb5f5f7c9b6c27e833ba1adbe17ff34125ae64225e61676aea91a

### 0. Health check
GET {{base}}/

###

### 1. Listar todos los conductores
GET {{base}}/conductores
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 2. Obtener conductor por ID
GET {{base}}/conductores/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 3. Crear conductor
POST {{base}}/conductores
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nombre": "Carlos Ramírez",
    "cedula": "1234567890",
    "licencia": "LIC-001",
    "telefono": "3001234567",
    "estado": "disponible"
}

###

### 4. Actualizar conductor
PUT {{base}}/conductores/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nombre": "Carlos A. Ramírez",
    "telefono": "3009999999"
}

###

### 5. Cambiar estado
PATCH {{base}}/conductores/1/estado
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "estado": "en_ruta"
}

###

### 6. Eliminar conductor
DELETE {{base}}/conductores/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}